{"id":"4774","groups":[{"type":"pnri","label":"相关图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4774_main_altocumulus-castellanus-and-cirrostratus-cumulonimbgenitus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc1\"><p>这是经典的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">堡状高积云</span>。有一些积云状的云塔，其中一些的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">高度大于它们的宽度</span>；各元素<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">排列成行</span>，每行中的元素具有<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">共同的水平云底</span>。</p>\n<p>堡状高积云是中等不稳定性的指标，通常会导致积雨云和雷暴的发展。2014年6月9日上午和下午在荷兰阿姆斯特丹观测到积雨云，当拍摄这张照片时，德国西部到西北部有大面积的雷暴。在地平线的左侧可以看到这些雷暴中的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">积雨云性卷层云</span>。</p>\n<p>在卷层云的南部（右侧）有一片遥远的<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">秃积雨云云顶</span>。未使用CL = 3，因为该细胞的底部超出了地平线。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Ger Breman","location":"荷兰","latitude":"纬度: 52° 27' 29'' N","longitude":"经度: 5° 49' 0'' E","date":"09 June 2014 1443 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向北东南","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 8, CH= 8","code":"图像P/S代码: S.4.4","imageId":"图像P/S代码: S.4.4"},{"src":"/images/original/syn/4774_syn_altocumulus-castellanus-and-cirrostratus-cumulonimbgenitus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc2\"><p>在冷锋面前，该站点处于暖空气区。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 皇冠版权","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/original/upper/4774_upper_altocumulus-castellanus-and-cirrostratus-cumulonimbgenitus_clouds.gif","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc3\"><p>从60公里到西南的探测。显示了有条件不稳定的低层和非常不稳定的中间层。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© 怀俄明大学","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""},{"src":"/images/compressed/sat/4774_sat_altocumulus-castellanus-and-cirrostratus-cumulonimbgenitus_clouds.jpg","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc4\"><p>在拍摄照片之前和之后，在该区域观测到了积雨云细胞。德国西北部有一个活跃的雷暴区；在照片的地平线上可以看到这些风暴中的卷云和卷层云。</p>\n</div>","copyright":"© EUMETSAT, 2013","location":"","latitude":"","longitude":"","date":"","direction":"","cloudCode":"","code":"","imageId":""}]},{"type":"seci","label":"其他图像","images":[{"src":"/images/compressed/4722_main_altocumulus-castellanus-radiatus_clouds.JPG","title":"","description":"<div class=\"img_desc\" id=\"desc5\"><p><span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">角塔形的积云状云塔</span>使这个云具有锯齿状的外观（云种为堡状）。积云状云簇的高度比宽度高，它们有一个<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">共同的水平云底</span>，并且以平行的带（辐状云类）的形式排列。这些云塔可能会继续发展并向浓积云过渡，因为其中一个<span style=\"color:var(--accent);font-weight:500;\">云带的发展看起来很重要</span>，不幸的是在最显著的位置被云掩盖住了。 </p>\n<p>云底显得太高而不能成为层积云，附近的高空探测和英国英格兰Dunkeswell机场的观测证实了这一点。 </p>\n</div>","copyright":"© Jim Galvin","location":"大不列颠及北爱尔兰联合王国德文郡埃克塞特","latitude":"纬度: 50° 43' 35'' N","longitude":"经度: 3° 28' 31'' W","date":"02 August 2015 1943 (当地时间)","direction":"摄像机方向：朝向东","cloudCode":"CL= 0, CM= 8, CH= 0","code":"图像P/S代码: P.4.4","imageId":"图像P/S代码: P.4.4"}]}]}